+# CI #1933 Triage — Auto-Landing Squash-Merge Race (PR #1932 lane), 2026-10-28
+
+**Issue:** #1933 (P2-medium, `area:ci`, `status:runway`) · **Failed run:** [40625744887](https://github.com/Supremeai-bd/supremeai-open/actions/runs/40625744887) · **Lane:** PR #1932 (`bridge/bridge-20261028-js-dep-cve-gate`, work order #1931)
+
+**Verdict:** No main-side defect and no code defect in the PR. The failing job is the tower's own `🛬 Autonomous Auto-Landing`: all verification tests and constitutional guards passed, then the squash-merge was attempted **10 seconds after** main moved (#1930 landed), and GitHub rejected it with `GraphQL: Pull Request has merge conflicts (mergePullRequest)`. The conflict is a single **generated file** (`scripts/ops/_INDEX.md`) that both PRs bumped for their own new scripts. The fix is a one-command rebase+regenerate in the PR-author lane, which board agents cannot perform (agents never push to another agent's bridge branch). This document is the triage evidence the issue's own lane classification calls "the actionable work".
+
+## 1. Verdict summary
+
+| Item | Finding |
+| --- | --- |
+| Failing job | `🛬 Autonomous Auto-Landing` (Run 40625744887) |
+| Failure mode | `GraphQL: Pull Request has merge conflicts (mergePullRequest)` → exit 1 |
+| Checks state at merge attempt | All verification tests + constitutional guards **passed** (log line: `✅ All verification tests and constitutional guards passed! Executing autonomous squash-merge...`) |
+| Root cause | Landing race: main advanced between check-pass and merge attempt |
+| Conflict partner | f94c736 (PR #1930, boundary sentinel), merged 2026-10-28T03:17:17Z |
+| Conflicting content | `scripts/ops/_INDEX.md` (auto-generated script index) — single file |
